An '''Aqua Admin''' (Japanese: '''アクアだんかんぶ''' ''Team Aqua Executive'') is a type of [[Pokémon Trainer]] that debuted in the [[Generation III]] {{pkmn|games}}.

The title has only specifically referred to two characters, [[Matt]] and [[Shelly]], as well as a third Aqua Admin, {{adv|Amber}}, whose only appearance is in the [[Pokémon Adventures]] {{pkmn|manga}}. The three of them make up the SSS trio in the manga, being the subleaders of [[Team Aqua]] under [[Archie]].

Aqua Admins specialize in {{t|Water}}- and {{type|Dark}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}}, namely {{p|Carvanha}} and {{p|Sharpedo}}.

