==In animation==
[[File:Shelly anime.png|thumb|250px|Shelly in {{aniseries|RS}}]]
===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|RS}}====
Only one Aqua Admin, [[Shelly]], appeared in the {{pkmn|animated series}}. She made her debut along with {{tc|Magma Admin}} [[Tabitha]] in ''[[AG027|A Three Team Scheme!]]'', where she was mistakenly referred to as "Tactical Commander Isabel" in the English [[dub]]; this was corrected in subsequent episodes. She led a squad on a mission to [[Dewford Town|Dewford Island]] to find the [[Cave of Origin]]. It was revealed that she was carrying the [[Red Orb]] (mistakenly referred to as the "Rose Orb" in the English dub) with her at the time, though it was never shown on-screen.

Shelly appeared several other times throughout ''[[Pokémon the Series: Ruby and Sapphire]]'' in command of {{tc|Team Aqua Grunt}}s: at [[Mt. Chimney]] in ''[[AG054|Fight for the Meteorite!]]'' and the [[Weather Institute]] in ''[[AG083|Unfair Weather Friends]]''. Her final appearance was in ''[[AG097|Gaining Groudon]]'' and ''[[AG098|The Scuffle of Legends]]'', where she freed Kyogre from Team Magma's ship and witnessed the battle between [[Kyogre and Groudon (Ruby and Sapphire series)#Kyogre|Kyogre]] and [[Kyogre and Groudon (Ruby and Sapphire series)#Groudon|Groudon]]. Like the rest of Team Aqua, she is not seen again after these episodes.
{{-}}

==In the manga==
[[File:SSS Adventures.png|thumb|250px|The SSS in [[Pokémon Adventures]]]]
===Pokémon Adventures===
===={{MangaArc|Ruby & Sapphire}}====
Aqua Grunts [[Matt]], [[Shelly]], and {{adv|Amber}} are promoted to Admin status by Archie in ''[[PS192|Stick This in Your Craw, Crawdaunt! I]]'' after they successfully steal the [[Devon Parts|Devon Goods]]. They become the 'SSS trio' - "Subleaders of the Sea Scheme." Later, they work together to use energy from [[Professor Cozmo]]'s meteorite to stop Mt. Chimney's activity, and though Sapphire defeats Matt, their plot is successful. They appear again in ''[[PS232|Always Keep Whiscash on You for Emergencies]]'' when Team Aqua and Team Magma briefly join forces to journey to the bottom of the sea. Archie takes Amber with him and nearly kills him in ''[[PS242|Very Vexing Volbeat]]'' by locking him and Magma Admin [[Tabitha]] inside the [[Submarine Explorer 1]].

During the battle between Kyogre and Groudon, the SSS trio fights against some of the Hoenn [[Gym Leader]]s. Matt is ultimately defeated by [[Winona]] and Shelly by [[Flannery]]. Amber defeats [[Wattson]], but also deliberately allows the Gym Leaders to find the location of the [[Team Aqua Hideout]], suggesting that Archie's treatment of him has caused him to defect from Team Aqua. The fate of Matt and Shelly is not known.

===={{MangaArc|Omega Ruby & Alpha Sapphire}}====
Amber returns to Team Aqua's {{ci|Lilycove}} Headquarters and unexpectedly encounters [[Blaise]]. The manga-exclusive counterparts eventually strike a deal to work together, and force {{p|Hoopa}} to summon {{p|Kyogre}} and {{p|Groudon}}, so that they would be able to trace their respective leaders' whereabouts. It is then revealed that "Matt" and "Shelly" were codenames for the game-based Aqua Admins; two new characters which resemble Matt and Shelly in {{g|Omega Ruby and Alpha Sapphire}} were introduced as co-operators with [[Zinnia]].

